Inherited delta-T data
---------------------

Stephenson, F. R., Morrison, L. V. & Hohenkerk, C. Y. 2016, Measurement of
the Earth's rotation: 720 BC to AD 2015. Proc. R. Soc. A 472: 20160404.
https://doi.org/10.1098/rspa.2016.0404
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The imported engine delta-T model uses Table S15 values and equation
constants from that work. The retained values are rounded; the engine
reconstructs the authors' spline. The companion does not alter that table.
The engine's later time values also derive from USNO and IERS data. Its
NOTICE identifies those products and centres, and its LICENSING.md preserves
the unresolved EOP 20 C04 terms.

